{"id": "1c075731-8609-4ad3-bbe1-a7316f25fbb1", "slug": "launch-in-an-instant", "title": "Launch in an instant", "description": "Launch Instant Hero Section is designed for introducing a product with clear above-the-fold messaging. Key features include headline hierarchy, supporting copy, and a primary call-to-action. It is suitable for homepage hero areas and campaign landing pages.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Launch in an instant\"\ndescription: \"Launch Instant Hero Section is designed for introducing a product with clear above-the-fold messaging. Key features include headline hierarchy, supporting copy, and a primary call-to-action. It is suitable for homepage hero areas and campaign landing pages.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#3B82F6\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#C678DD\"\n  background: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  surface: \"#1A1D27\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#8B8D98\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"24px\"\n  control: \"24px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Launch in an instant\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Aksonvady Phomhome (@aksonvady). Views: 202; favorites: 8; remixes: 1.\nTags: cta, animated, webgl, threejs, dither, effect, action, bento.\n## Overview\nLaunch Instant Hero Section is designed for introducing a product with clear above-the-fold messaging. Key features include headline hierarchy, supporting copy, and a primary call-to-action. It is suitable for homepage hero areas and campaign landing pages.\n\nLaunch in an instant. Your website is lightning-fast from the get-go and automatically fine-tuned for optimal search engine performance. Get Started No code, total control. Utilize robust Scroll and Appear effects such…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Launch in an instant. Your website is lightning-fast from the get-go and automatically fine-tuned for optimal search engine performance.; No code, total control.; Express your creativity; Effortless Issue Tracking; Website Management.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #3B82F6, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #C678DD, background #FFFFFF, surface #1A1D27, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and JetBrains Mono for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Launch in an instant</title>\n\n    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Iconify -->\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- GSAP -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Three.js for WebGL Background -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Google Fonts: Inter -->\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n    <script>\n        tailwind.config = {\n            theme: {\n                extend: {\n                    fontFamily: {\n                        sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],\n                        mono: ['JetBrains Mono', 'monospace'],\n                    },\n                    colors: {\n                        surface: '#0B0D14',\n                        surface_elevated: '#13151D',\n                        text_muted: '#8B8D98',\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n\n    <style>\n        body {\n            background-color: #030407; /* Deep space dark base */\n            color: #ffffff;\n            overflow-x: hidden;\n            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n            -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;\n        }\n\n        /* Framed Layout Lines */\n        .grid-guide {\n            position: fixed;\n            top: 0;\n            bottom: 0;\n            width: 1px;\n            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 10%, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 90%, transparent);\n            z-index: 0;\n            pointer-events: none;\n        }\n\n        .l-bracket {\n            position: absolute;\n            width: 12px;\n            height: 12px;\n            border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);\n            border-style: solid;\n            pointer-events: none;\n            z-index: 10;\n        }\n\n        /* Skeuomorphic Glass Surfaces */\n        .glass-card {\n            background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(19, 21, 29, 0.8) 0%, rgba(11, 13, 20, 0.9) 100%);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(24px);\n            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(24px);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);\n            box-shadow:\n                inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12), /* Top highlight */\n                inset 0 -1px 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8),       /* Bottom shadow */\n                0 10px 30px -10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);      /* Elevation drop */\n            position: relative;\n            isolation: isolate;\n        }\n\n        .glass-card::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            inset: 0;\n            border-radius: inherit;\n            padding: 1px;\n            background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 100%);\n            -webkit-mask: linear-gradient(#fff 0 0) content-box, linear-gradient(#fff 0 0);\n            -webkit-mask-composite: xor;\n            mask-composite: exclude;\n            pointer-events: none;\n            opacity: 0.5;\n        }\n\n        /* Hover Glow Effect */\n        .glass-card::after {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            inset: -1px;\n            border-radius: inherit;\n            background: radial-gradient(600px circle at var(--mouse-x, 50%) var(--mouse-y, 50%), rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15), transparent 40%);\n            opacity: 0;\n            transition: opacity 0.5s ease;\n            pointer-events: none;\n            z-index: -1;\n        }\n        .glass-card:hover::after {\n            opacity: 1;\n        }\n\n        /* Gradient Text */\n        .text-gradient {\n            background: linear-gradient(to right, #ffffff, #a1a1aa);\n            -webkit-background-clip: text;\n            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\n            background-clip: text;\n        }\n\n        /* Custom Scrollbar for Code Block */\n        .code-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar {\n            width: 4px;\n        }\n        .code-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\n            background: transparent;\n        }\n        .code-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n            border-radius: 4px;\n        }\n\n        /* Chart Animations */\n        .chart-bar {\n            transform-origin: bottom;\n        }\n\n        /* WebGL Canvas */\n        #webgl-canvas {\n            position: fixed;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 100vw;\n            height: 100vh;\n            z-index: 0;\n            pointer-events: none;\n            mix-blend-mode: screen;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"selection:bg-blue-500/30 selection:text-white\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL Background Container -->\n    <canvas id=\"webgl-canvas\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Structural Grid Lines (Framed Layout) -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 flex justify-center pointer-events-none\">\n        <div class=\"w-full max-w-[1240px] h-full relative\">\n            <div class=\"grid-guide left-0\"></div>\n            <div class=\"grid-guide right-0\"></div>\n            <div class=\"grid-guide left-1/4 opacity-50 hidden lg:block\"></div>\n            <div class=\"grid-guide left-2/4 opacity-50 hidden lg:block\"></div>\n            <div class=\"grid-guide left-3/4 opacity-50 hidden lg:block\"></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Main Content Area -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 w-full min-h-screen pt-24 pb-32 px-6 lg:px-8 flex flex-col items-center\">\n\n        <div class=\"w-full max-w-[1200px]\">\n\n            <!-- Hero Header -->\n            <div class=\"max-w-4xl mb-20 relative\">\n                <!-- Decorative Corner -->\n                <div class=\"l-bracket top-0 left-0 border-t border-l -translate-x-6 -translate-y-6\"></div>\n\n                <h1 class=\"hero-title text-[clamp(2rem,4vw,3.5rem)] leading-[1.15] font-medium tracking-tight mb-6\">\n                    <span class=\"text-white\">Launch in an instant.</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-text_muted\">Your website is lightning-fast from the get-go and automatically fine-tuned for optimal search engine performance.</span>\n                </h1>\n\n                <div class=\"hero-cta relative inline-flex mt-4 group\">\n                    <!-- Intense Outer Glow -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute -inset-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#D946EF] via-[#8B5CF6] to-[#3B82F6] rounded-full blur-2xl opacity-40 group-hover:opacity-70 transition duration-700 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n                    <!-- Button Surface -->\n                    <button class=\"relative flex items-center justify-center gap-2 h-14 px-8 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-[#D946EF] to-[#3B82F6] text-white font-medium text-sm tracking-wide shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.4),0_4px_14px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-[1.02] active:scale-[0.98]\">\n                        Get Started\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-lg opacity-80\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Bento Grid Section -->\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-5 relative\">\n\n                <!-- Card 1: Code Control (Span 7) -->\n                <div class=\"bento-card glass-card rounded-[24px] col-span-1 lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col lg:flex-row overflow-hidden min-h-[400px]\">\n\n                    <!-- Text Content -->\n                    <div class=\"p-10 lg:w-[45%] flex flex-col justify-center z-10 relative\">\n                        <h2 class=\"text-xl font-medium tracking-tight text-white mb-3\">No code, total control.</h2>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-text_muted leading-relaxed\">\n                            Utilize robust Scroll and Appear effects such as Transforms and Parallax scrolling to animate your website and make it stand out from the rest.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Graphic Content: Code Editor Skeuomorph -->\n                    <div class=\"relative flex-1 min-h-[250px] lg:min-h-full flex items-center justify-end overflow-hidden pl-10 lg:pl-0\">\n                        <!-- Code Window Frame -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute right-[-20px] top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[110%] lg:w-[420px] h-[85%] bg-[#151720] rounded-l-[16px] border border-white/[0.08] shadow-2xl flex flex-col transform rotate-0 lg:-rotate-2 hover:rotate-0 transition-transform duration-700 ease-out\">\n\n                            <!-- Window Header -->\n                            <div class=\"h-12 border-b border-white/[0.05] flex items-center justify-between px-4 bg-[#1A1D27]/50\">\n                                <div class=\"flex gap-2\">\n                                    <div class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-white/10 shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.1)]\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-white/10 shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.1)]\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-white/10 shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.1)]\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"flex text-[10px] text-text_muted gap-6 mr-10 font-mono tracking-wide\">\n                                    <span class=\"text-white font-medium border-b border-white/20 pb-[2px]\">CSS</span>\n                                    <span>React</span>\n                                    <span>Tailwind</span>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Code Body -->\n                            <div class=\"p-5 flex-1 overflow-hidden code-scroll text-[11px] font-mono leading-[1.8] text-slate-300 relative select-none\">\n                                <!-- Line Numbers -->\n                                <div class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-10 border-r border-white/[0.02] bg-[#151720] flex flex-col items-end pt-5 pr-3 text-white/20\">\n                                    <span>1</span><span>2</span><span>3</span><span>4</span><span>5</span><span>6</span><span>7</span><span>8</span><span>9</span><span>10</span><span>11</span>\n                                </div>\n\n                                <div class=\"pl-8\">\n                                    <span class=\"text-slate-500 italic\">// Type or paste the code you want to highlight</span><br>\n                                    <span class=\"text-slate-500 italic\">// below</span><br>\n                                    <span class=\"text-slate-500 italic\">// or select a text node and run the plugin</span><br>\n                                    <br>\n                                    <span class=\"text-[#c678dd]\">import</span> <span class=\"text-[#e5c07b]\">syntaxHighlight</span> <span class=\"text-[#c678dd]\">from</span> <span class=\"text-[#98c379]\">'syntax-highlighter'</span><br>\n                                    <br>\n                                    <span class=\"text-[#c678dd]\">const</span> <span class=\"text-[#e06c75]\">codeBlock</span> = <span class=\"text-[#e5c07b]\">document</span>.<span class=\"text-[#61afef]\">querySelector</span>(<span class=\"text-[#98c379]\"\">\"#code\"</span>)<br>\n                                    <br>\n                                    <span class=\"text-[#c678dd]\">function</span> <span class=\"text-[#61afef]\">highlight</span>(<span class=\"text-[#e06c75]\">code</span>) {<br>\n                                    &nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"text-[#c678dd]\">return</span> <span class=\"text-[#61afef]\">syntaxHighlight</span>(<span class=\"text-[#e06c75]\">code</span>)<br>\n                                    }<br>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Gradient overlay for code fadeout -->\n                            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-16 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#151720] to-transparent pointer-events-none\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Card 2: Express Creativity (Span 5) -->\n                <div class=\"bento-card glass-card rounded-[24px] col-span-1 lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col overflow-hidden min-h-[400px]\">\n\n                    <!-- Graphic Content: Concentric Rings -->\n                    <div class=\"h-[220px] w-full relative flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden pt-6\">\n                        <!-- Glowing backdrop -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-48 h-48 bg-blue-500/10 blur-[50px] rounded-full\"></div>\n\n                        <!-- SVG Dotted Rings -->\n                        <svg width=\"280\" height=\"280\" viewBox=\"0 0 280 280\" class=\"opacity-40 animate-spin-slow\">\n                            <defs>\n                                <radialGradient id=\"ringGrad\" cx=\"50%\" cy=\"50%\" r=\"50%\">\n                                    <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#ffffff\" stop-opacity=\"1\" />\n                                    <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#3B82F6\" stop-opacity=\"0.2\" />\n                                </radialGradient>\n                            </defs>\n                            <g stroke=\"url(#ringGrad)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\">\n                                <!-- Inner to Outer Rings with varying dash arrays -->\n                                <circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"140\" r=\"20\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 6\" />\n                                <circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"140\" r=\"40\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 8\" />\n                                <circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"140\" r=\"60\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 10\" />\n                                <circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"140\" r=\"80\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 12\" />\n                                <circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"140\" r=\"100\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 15\" opacity=\"0.8\"/>\n                                <circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"140\" r=\"120\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 20\" opacity=\"0.6\"/>\n                                <circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"140\" r=\"140\" stroke-dasharray=\"8 30\" opacity=\"0.4\"/>\n                            </g>\n                        </svg>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Text Content -->\n                    <div class=\"p-8 pt-4 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-end relative z-10\">\n                        <h2 class=\"text-xl font-medium tracking-tight text-white mb-2\">Express your creativity</h2>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-text_muted leading-relaxed\">\n                            Instantly elevate your websites by effortlessly incorporating captivating Hover, Press, Loop, and Drag interactions and animations with just a few clicks.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Card 3: Issue Tracking (Span 6) -->\n                <div class=\"bento-card glass-card rounded-[24px] col-span-1 lg:col-span-6 flex flex-col overflow-hidden min-h-[400px]\">\n\n                    <!-- Graphic Content: Bar Chart UI -->\n                    <div class=\"h-[220px] w-full relative flex items-end justify-center pt-10 px-10 pb-6\">\n\n                        <!-- Chart Container Skeuomorph -->\n                        <div class=\"w-full max-w-[320px] h-[160px] relative border border-white/[0.05] rounded-[16px] bg-[#12141C]/50 shadow-[inset_0_2px_10px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] p-4 flex flex-col\">\n\n                            <!-- Filter Tabs -->\n                            <div class=\"absolute -top-4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 flex items-center gap-1 bg-[#1A1D27] border border-white/10 rounded-full p-1 shadow-lg\">\n                                <div class=\"px-4 py-1 text-[10px] text-text_muted font-medium cursor-default\">Day</div>\n                                <div class=\"px-4 py-1 text-[10px] text-white bg-white/10 rounded-full shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.1)] font-medium cursor-default\">Week</div>\n                                <div class=\"px-4 py-1 text-[10px] text-text_muted font-medium cursor-default\">Month</div>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Y-Axis Labels -->\n                            <div class=\"absolute left-4 top-4 bottom-8 flex flex-col justify-between text-[9px] font-mono text-white/30\">\n                                <span>100%</span>\n                                <span>60%</span>\n                                <span>20%</span>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Grid Lines -->\n                            <div class=\"absolute left-12 right-4 top-5 bottom-8 flex flex-col justify-between\">\n                                <div class=\"w-full h-px bg-white/[0.03]\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"w-full h-px bg-white/[0.03]\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"w-full h-px bg-white/[0.03]\"></div>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Bars -->\n                            <div class=\"ml-8 flex-1 flex items-end justify-between px-2 gap-3 relative z-10\">\n                                <!-- Bar 1 -->\n                                <div class=\"chart-bar w-full bg-gradient-to-t from-white/[0.02] to-white/[0.15] border border-white/[0.08] rounded-t-[4px] shadow-[inset_0_2px_4px_rgba(255,255,255,0.1)]\" style=\"height: 65%;\"></div>\n                                <!-- Bar 2 -->\n                                <div class=\"chart-bar w-full bg-gradient-to-t from-white/[0.02] to-white/[0.12] border border-white/[0.08] rounded-t-[4px] shadow-[inset_0_2px_4px_rgba(255,255,255,0.1)]\" style=\"height: 45%;\"></div>\n                                <!-- Bar 3 -->\n                                <div class=\"chart-bar w-full bg-gradient-to-t from-white/[0.02] to-white/[0.08] border border-white/[0.05] rounded-t-[4px]\" style=\"height: 30%;\"></div>\n                                <!-- Bar 4 -->\n                                <div class=\"chart-bar w-full bg-gradient-to-t from-white/[0.02] to-white/[0.1] border border-white/[0.05] rounded-t-[4px]\" style=\"height: 80%;\"></div>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- X-Axis Labels -->\n                            <div class=\"absolute bottom-2 left-12 right-4 flex justify-between text-[8px] font-mono text-white/30\">\n                                <span>1-7 nov</span>\n                                <span>8-14 nov</span>\n                                <span>15-21 nov</span>\n                                <span class=\"hidden sm:inline\">22-28 nov</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Text Content -->\n                    <div class=\"p-8 pt-2 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-end relative z-10\">\n                        <h2 class=\"text-xl font-medium tracking-tight text-white mb-2\">Effortless Issue Tracking</h2>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-text_muted leading-relaxed\">\n                            Experience a seamless workflow with our intuitive issue tracking system. Effortlessly create tasks within seconds, engage in contextual discussions about issues, and navigate.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Card 4: Website Management (Span 6) -->\n                <div class=\"bento-card glass-card rounded-[24px] col-span-1 lg:col-span-6 flex flex-col overflow-hidden min-h-[400px]\">\n\n                    <!-- Graphic Content: Stacked Cards -->\n                    <div class=\"h-[220px] w-full relative flex items-center justify-center pt-8 overflow-hidden\">\n\n                        <!-- Card Stack Container -->\n                        <div class=\"relative w-[300px] h-[160px] translate-y-4\">\n\n                            <!-- Card Back -->\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[#1A1D27]/80 backdrop-blur-md rounded-[16px] border border-white/[0.05] shadow-lg transform -translate-y-8 scale-90 opacity-40 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden\">\n                                <div class=\"w-[80%] h-[1px] bg-white/10 absolute top-1/4\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"w-[60%] h-[1px] bg-white/10 absolute top-2/4 left-[10%]\"></div>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Card Middle -->\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[#1A1D27] backdrop-blur-xl rounded-[16px] border border-white/[0.08] shadow-xl transform -translate-y-4 scale-95 opacity-70 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden\">\n                                <!-- Abstract pattern -->\n                                <div class=\"w-32 h-32 border border-white/5 rounded-full absolute -right-10 -top-10\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"w-48 h-48 border border-white/5 rounded-full absolute -right-16 -top-16\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"w-10 h-2 bg-white/10 rounded absolute bottom-6 left-6\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"w-20 h-2 bg-white/5 rounded absolute bottom-6 left-20\"></div>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Card Front -->\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#1E2130] to-[#12141C] backdrop-blur-2xl rounded-[16px] border border-white/[0.12] shadow-[0_20px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6),inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.15)] flex flex-col overflow-hidden transition-transform duration-500 hover:-translate-y-2 group\">\n\n                                <!-- Top Bar -->\n                                <div class=\"h-8 border-b border-white/[0.05] flex items-center px-4\">\n                                    <div class=\"w-6 h-1 rounded-full bg-white/20\"></div>\n                                </div>\n\n                                <!-- Content layout -->\n                                <div class=\"p-5 flex-1 relative\">\n                                    <div class=\"w-1/2 h-3 bg-white/20 rounded mb-3 shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.1)]\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"w-3/4 h-2 bg-white/10 rounded mb-2\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"w-2/3 h-2 bg-white/10 rounded\"></div>\n\n                                    <!-- Circular visual element -->\n                                    <div class=\"absolute right-4 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-16 h-16 rounded-full border-[2px] border-blue-500/20 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                                        <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full border-[1px] border-blue-400/40 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                                            <div class=\"w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-blue-500/60 shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(59,130,246,0.5)]\"></div>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n\n                                <!-- Subtle reflection overlay -->\n                                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-tr from-transparent via-white/[0.02] to-white/[0.05] pointer-events-none\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Text Content -->\n                    <div class=\"p-8 pt-2 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-end relative z-10\">\n                        <h2 class=\"text-xl font-medium tracking-tight text-white mb-2\">Website Management</h2>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-text_muted leading-relaxed\">\n                            Enhance the visual appeal of your website for a remarkable sharing experience. Implement a staging domain to review and refine changes prior to deployment.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Bottom Corner Brackets for structural framing -->\n            <div class=\"l-bracket bottom-0 right-0 border-b border-r translate-x-6 translate-y-6 hidden lg:block\"></div>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        // WebGL Background Initialization (Dot Matrix Particle Field)\n        function initWebGL() {\n            const canvas = document.getElementById('webgl-canvas');\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n\n            // Fog for soft depth fade\n            scene.fog = new THREE.FogExp2(0x030407, 0.0015);\n\n            const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(75, window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight, 0.1, 1000);\n            camera.position.z = 300;\n\n            const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ canvas, alpha: true, antialias: true });\n            renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2)); // DPR clamp\n            renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n\n            // Create Dot Matrix Geometry\n            const geometry = new THREE.BufferGeometry();\n            const particlesCount = 2500;\n            const posArray = new Float32Array(particlesCount * 3);\n\n            for(let i = 0; i < particlesCount * 3; i+=3) {\n                // Spread points widely\n                posArray[i] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 2000;     // x\n                posArray[i+1] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 1500;   // y\n                posArray[i+2] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 800 - 200; // z (pushed slightly back)\n            }\n\n            geometry.setAttribute('position', new THREE.BufferAttribute(posArray, 3));\n\n            // Custom Shader Material for breathing and styling\n            const material = new THREE.ShaderMaterial({\n                uniforms: {\n                    time: { value: 0 },\n                    color: { value: new THREE.Color(0x3B82F6) } // Electric Blue\n                },\n                vertexShader: `\n                    uniform float time;\n                    varying float vAlpha;\n                    void main() {\n                        // Subtle breathing pulse based on position and time\n                        vec3 pos = position;\n                        float wave = sin(pos.x * 0.005 + time) * cos(pos.y * 0.005 + time) * 10.0;\n                        pos.z += wave;\n\n                        vec4 mvPosition = modelViewMatrix * vec4(pos, 1.0);\n                        gl_PointSize = (4.0 / -mvPosition.z) * 100.0; // Size attenuation\n                        gl_Position = projectionMatrix * mvPosition;\n\n                        // Depth fade alpha calculation\n                        vAlpha = smoothstep(200.0, -800.0, mvPosition.z) * 0.5;\n                    }\n                `,\n                fragmentShader: `\n                    uniform vec3 color;\n                    uniform float time;\n                    varying float vAlpha;\n                    void main() {\n                        // Circular dot\n                        float r = distance(gl_PointCoord, vec2(0.5));\n                        if(r > 0.5) discard;\n\n                        // Global breathing opacity\n                        float pulse = (sin(time * 0.5) * 0.2) + 0.8;\n                        gl_FragColor = vec4(color, vAlpha * pulse * 0.6);\n                    }\n                `,\n                transparent: true,\n                depthWrite: false,\n                blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending\n            });\n\n            const particlesMesh = new THREE.Points(geometry, material);\n            scene.add(particlesMesh);\n\n            // Pointer Reactive Drift\n            let mouseX = 0;\n            let mouseY = 0;\n            let targetX = 0;\n            let targetY = 0;\n            const windowHalfX = window.innerWidth / 2;\n            const windowHalfY = window.innerHeight / 2;\n\n            document.addEventListener('mousemove', (event) => {\n                mouseX = (event.clientX - windowHalfX);\n                mouseY = (event.clientY - windowHalfY);\n            });\n\n            const clock = new THREE.Clock();\n\n            function animate() {\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n                const elapsedTime = clock.getElapsedTime();\n\n                // Update uniforms\n                material.uniforms.time.value = elapsedTime;\n\n                // Drift effect\n                targetX = mouseX * 0.05;\n                targetY = mouseY * 0.05;\n\n                particlesMesh.rotation.y += 0.0005;\n                particlesMesh.rotation.x += 0.0002;\n\n                // Parallax easing\n                camera.position.x += (targetX - camera.position.x) * 0.02;\n                camera.position.y += (-targetY - camera.position.y) * 0.02;\n                camera.lookAt(scene.position);\n\n                renderer.render(scene, camera);\n            }\n\n            animate();\n\n            // Resize handler\n            window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                camera.aspect = window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight;\n                camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n                renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            });\n        }\n\n        // GSAP Animations & Interactions\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            initWebGL();\n\n            // Setup CSS variables for card hover glow tracking\n            document.querySelectorAll('.bento-card').forEach(card => {\n                card.addEventListener('mousemove', e => {\n                    const rect = card.getBoundingClientRect();\n                    const x = e.clientX - rect.left;\n                    const y = e.clientY - rect.top;\n                    card.style.setProperty('--mouse-x', `${x}px`);\n                    card.style.setProperty('--mouse-y', `${y}px`);\n                });\n            });\n\n            // GSAP Entrance Timeline\n            const tl = gsap.timeline({ defaults: { ease: 'power3.out' } });\n\n            tl.fromTo('.hero-title',\n                { y: 30, opacity: 0 },\n                { y: 0, opacity: 1, duration: 1, delay: 0.2 }\n            )\n            .fromTo('.hero-cta',\n                { y: 20, opacity: 0, scale: 0.95 },\n                { y: 0, opacity: 1, scale: 1, duration: 0.8 },\n                \"-=0.6\"\n            )\n            .fromTo('.bento-card',\n                { y: 40, opacity: 0 },\n                { y: 0, opacity: 1, duration: 0.8, stagger: 0.1 },\n                \"-=0.4\"\n            );\n\n            // Chart bars staggered growth\n            gsap.fromTo('.chart-bar',\n                { scaleY: 0 },\n                { scaleY: 1, duration: 1, ease: 'back.out(1.5)', stagger: 0.1, delay: 1.2 }\n            );\n        });\n    </script>\n\n    <style>\n        /* CSS keyframes for fallback/additional motion */\n        @keyframes spin-slow {\n            from { transform: rotate(0deg); }\n            to { transform: rotate(360deg); }\n        }\n        .animate-spin-slow {\n            animation: spin-slow 40s linear infinite;\n        }\n    </style>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "launch-in-an-instant.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/launch-in-an-instant.jpg", "source_name": "launch-in-an-instant-DESIGN.md", "views": 285, "forks": 2, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "2e815afb-cac1-4c01-90e1-cf3810246e35", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-01T18:40:16.751282+00:00"}